      "sourceHeading": "Google Super is a unified Google Workspace toolkit"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/googlesuper/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "Google Meet through Google Super needs Meet scopes and Google Meet API enabled"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/googlesuper/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "Google Super can be narrowed by removing unneeded scopes and tools"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/googlesuper/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "Gmail filter creation through Google Super also requires `gmail.settings.basic`"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/googlesuper/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "`GOOGLESUPER_LIST_LABELS` with `include_details=true` can be slow because it fans out per label"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/googlesuper/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "Gmail thread listing includes `resultSizeEstimate`"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/googlesuper/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "Use Gmail/Google Super query and label filters to find sent or labeled messages"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/googlesuper/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "Google Super Sheets 404s can mean wrong spreadsheet ID, missing access, or missing spreadsheet scope"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/googlesuper/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "`Connection initiation did not complete within 10 minutes` means OAuth consent was not completed, not token refresh failure"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/googlesuper/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "Google users can deselect scopes during consent; Composio marks active if token exchange succeeds"
    }
